# Write change notes

<h2 id="wg-091">Say what changed and why it matters</h2>

Write a change note when the meaning, a step or a result changed. Say what changed first. Do not write one for typos, layout or a fixed link.

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Updated the page. | Clarified that turning off an automation stops future starts. It may not stop a run already in progress. |
| Changed some labels. | Changed “Switch” to “Turn on” on the hall light card so the label matches the action. |
| Fixed a typo in the heating help. | (No change note. A typo does not change meaning.) |

Write full sentences. Name the page, card or section that changed. If many things changed, list where.
